  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.6 - Convert null attribute set to object when setting value by key.\n\t\t\t1.2.5 - Rebuild with added HTML and URL encode and decode methods.\n\t\t\t1.2.4 - Move HTTP request retry strategy to the utility interface library.\n\t\t\t1.2.3 - Expose internal classes to unit test assembly.\n\t\t\t1.2.2 - Fix object comparison in attribute parser.\n\t\t\t1.2.1 - Use TimeSpan.Milliseconds for month and year duration computations.\n\t\t\t1.2.0 - Update duration computation to return milliseconds.\n\t\t\t1.1.3 - Loggers are non-nullable.\n\t\t\t1.1.2 - Fix key generation for 'Pin8' type.\n\t\t\t1.1.1 - Extract product version from 'InformationalVersion'.\n\t\t\t1.1.0 - Use interface to scoped object provider.\n\t\t\t1.0.23 - Add attribute conversion to string list map.\n\t\t\t\t   - Add date/time extension methods for Unix epoch conversions.\n\t\t\t\t   - Fix email address validation.\n\t\t\t1.0.22 - Use extension methods for Unix epoch functions.\n\t\t\t1.0.21 - Rebuild with geographic coordinate obfuscation.\n\t\t\t1.0.20 - Create a clone of the 'HttpRequestMessage' object for each retry attempt.\n\t\t\t1.0.19 - Add configurable retry strategy to HTTP requests.\n\t\t\t1.0.18 - Rebuild with default timestamp for service result.\n\t\t\t1.0.17 - Add method to get time zone offset for locale and date.\n\t\t\t1.0.16 - Rebuild with enum extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.15 - Rebuild with type for geographic coordinates.\n\t\t\t1.0.14 - Add factory to provide a disposable scoped object.\n\t\t\t1.0.13 - Allow metadata lookup to have leading and/or trailing whitespace.\n\t\t\t1.0.12 - Add validator for mobile phone numbers of Malta.\n\t\t\t1.0.11 - Update third-party NuGet packages.\n\t\t\t1.0.10 - Fix logging message.\n\t\t\t1.0.9 - Add method to fetch a value from a list of key-value pairs.\n\t\t\t1.0.8 - Rebuild with updated time unit enum.\n\t\t\t1.0.7 - Rebuild with updated time unit enum and interface for HTTP 'Post' and 'Put' requests.\n\t\t\t1.0.6 - Add parameter to ignore null values in serialised body of HTTP 'Post' and 'Put' requests.\n\t\t\t1.0.5 - Load environment variables after configuration files.\n\t\t\t1.0.4 - Add greater selection of string conversion methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.3 - Fix fetch of product description.\n\t\t\t1.0.2 - Initial revision, targetting .NET 8",
